{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"TUIkit"}],"role":"article","title":"Architecture","roleHeading":"Article"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/AppLifecycle","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderCycle"],"title":"Essentials","anchor":"Essentials","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TUIkit is structured in six layers, each building on the one below. This clean separation makes the framework easy to extend and maintain."}]},{"level":2,"text":"Layer Model","type":"heading","anchor":"Layer-Model"},{"level":3,"text":"1. App Layer","type":"heading","anchor":"1-App-Layer"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/App","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" protocol is the entry point. It defines one or more scenes that make up your application. The internal "},{"code":"AppRunner","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" manages the async event loop, terminal setup, signal handling, and event dispatching."}]},{"syntax":null,"code":["@main → App → AppRunner → RuntimeEventChannel"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"text":"2. View Layer","type":"heading","anchor":"2-View-Layer"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Every UI component conforms to the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/View"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol. Views are composed declaratively using "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ViewBuilder"},{"type":"text","text":", which supports:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Single and multiple child views (up to 10)"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Conditionals (","type":"text"},{"code":"if","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"if-else","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"if let","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Loops (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"for-in"},{"text":" via ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ForEach","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Built-in views include:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Content"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Text"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Spinner"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Divider"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/EmptyView"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Interactive controls"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Button","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/TextField","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/SecureField","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Toggle","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\